Debug mode highlights a frontmatter field from its key to the end of its value, every line of a
value written over several lines included, but not a comment line after it.
== args
--debug
input/doc.md
== file input/doc.md
---
description: >
  Folded over
  two lines
# A comment.
title: Doc
---
# Doc
== stdout
---
\x1b[32mdescription: >\x1b[0m
\x1b[32m  Folded over\x1b[0m
\x1b[32m  two lines\x1b[0m
# A comment.
\x1b[32mtitle: Doc\x1b[0m
---
\x1b[32m# Doc\x1b[0m
== stderr
== exit 0
